<title>USA: CCC brings forward tender for wheat to Iraq.</title>
<headline>CCC brings forward tender for wheat to Iraq.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said extended to November 20, its deadline for offers of up to 16,100 tonnes of U.S. wheat for export to Iraq.</p>
<p>CCC seeks number two or better wheat, excluding unclassed, mixed and durum wheat. Offers had originally been due on November 21 for reply the following day.</p>
<p>Shipment is slated for December 5-30.</p>
<p>--Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
